[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0002","text":"摄影导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0010","text":"……然后呢，新生就是从这扇门进去的流程\n大概就是这样，果穗酱觉得能行吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0020","text":"……是"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0023","text":"拍摄工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0030","text":"啊，小宫小姐！那边是灯光侧\n小宫小姐要从那边进去的路线"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0040","text":"……！\n对不起……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0050","text":"……哈哈，怎么说呢\n感觉像英雄变身前的样子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0060","text":"你看……不管是当大小姐，还是当英雄\n都是变成另一个自己，这点上其实是一样的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0080","text":"小宫小—姐！\n请准备就位！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0090","text":"……哦，轮到我们了\n好，走吧果穗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_03_0100","text":"是……"}]
